2026-06-25 03:30:31,729 [INFO]     MORNING_WIN_START (09:15) and MORNING_WIN_END (10:15): if a closed FUT 15m
2026-06-25 03:30:31,729 [INFO]     bar crosses its VWAP (body 65-86%) AND its close is > MORNING_VWAP_SR_MIN_DIST
2026-06-25 03:30:31,729 [INFO]     (20pt) from every pivot S1/R1/S2/R2 → buy in the cross direction. Re-entries
2026-06-25 03:30:31,729 [INFO]     per momentum gate. Uses engine 'VWAP' (so it inherits the VWAP option-VWAP
2026-06-25 03:30:31,729 [INFO]     trail exit). Runs even when in_entry_window() is False; still respects
2026-06-25 03:30:31,729 [INFO]     stale-guard, gap-suppress, CB/halt, manual cooldown. check_morning_vwap15_signal().
2026-06-25 03:30:31,729 [INFO]     INTERPRETATION: this only ADDS the pre-09:45 window; from 09:45 on, the
2026-06-25 03:30:31,729 [INFO]     normal engines (incl. Feature 1) already run. No confirmation candle is
